&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:36pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-27pt;"&gt;(注)　普通株式の自己株式数には役員報酬BIP信託が保有する当社株式（当連結会計年度末90,950株）が含まれて&lt;br/&gt;おります。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;font-size:13pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingIssuedSharesAndTreasurySharesTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingNewShareSubscriptionRightsEtcTextBlock contextRef="Prior1YearDuration">&lt;p class="smt_head6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:9pt;"&gt;３　新株予約権等に関する事項&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:45pt;"&gt;　該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingNewShareSubscriptionRightsEtcTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingDividendTextBlock contextRef="Prior1YearDuration">&lt;p style="page-break-before:always; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_head6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;４　配当に関する事項&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_head6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:18pt;"&gt;(1) 配当金支払額&lt;/p&gt;
